          "path": "_m/9/q/c/z/empire-mine-state-historic-park-wp/empire-mine-state-historical-p.jpg",
          "filename": "EMPIRE MINE STATE HISTORICAL PARK, CALIFORNIA.jpg",
          "caption": "ONE OF THE MOST SUCCESSFUL OF HARD ROCK GOLD MINES IN THE U.S. FIRST DISCOVERED BY A LUMBERMAN IN THE 1850'S BUT DIFFICULT TO OBTAIN THE GOLD. BOUGHT BY WILLIAM BOURN WHO \tSUCCESSFULLY DEVELOPED THE MINE TO A 12,000' DEPTH.  THIS PICTURE SHOWS THE HOIST HOUSE; SKILLED HOIST MEN RAISED AND LOWERED MEN AND SUPPLIES WITH STARTLING RAPIDITY",
          "alt": "ONE OF THE MOST SUCCESSFUL OF HARD ROCK GOLD MINES IN THE U.S. FIRST DISCOVERED BY A LUMBERMAN IN THE 1850'S BUT DIFFICULT TO OBTAIN THE GOLD. BOUGHT BY WILLIAM BOURN WHO \tSUCCESSFULLY DEVELOPED THE MINE TO A 12,000' DEPTH.  THIS PICTURE SHOWS THE HOIST HOUSE; SKILLED HOIST MEN RAISED AND LOWERED MEN AND SUPPLIES WITH STARTLING RAPIDITY",
